  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rvben/rumdl/tarball/v0.3.8",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rvben/rumdl/zipball/v0.3.8",
  "body": "\n### Added\n\n- **MD009**: add opt-in backslash hard line breaks with `hard-break-style = \"backslash\"` ([8feb205](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/8feb2054f26f3130101da43c44e6304523c09938))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **MD041**: honor configured front matter titles ([4a05b06](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/4a05b06c78c22719731b989ff6495d414dbcebb0))\n- **MD003**: list the `setext` alias in the configuration schema ([3c258b4](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/3c258b4dfdc4aa16a509a9ccc60dc88eba26072e))\n\n\n## Downloads\n\n| File | Platform | Checksum |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| [rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | Linux x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz) | Linux x86_64 (musl) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | Linux ARM64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz) | Linux ARM64 (musl) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | macOS x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | macOS ARM64 (Apple Silicon) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | Windows x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.8/rumdl-v0.3.8-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n\n## Installation\n\n### Using uv (Recommended)\n```bash\nuv tool install rumdl\n```\n\n### Using pip\n```bash\npip install rumdl\n```\n\n### Using pipx\n```bash\npipx install rumdl\n```\n\n### Direct Download\nDownload the appropriate binary for your platform from the table above, extract it, and add it to your PATH.\n",
